(1128534, 139100, 26679, '<td valign="top">Not a lot of shoveling gone on yet.<br/>O like the selective desat here. a hint of pink and blue, does look good.</td>', 'Not a lot of shoveling gone on yet.O like the selective desat here. a hint of pink and blue, does look good.', '2005-01-24 04:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128543, 138966, 7438, '<td valign="top">Heh, I smell a series coming on.<br/> <br/>What I like about it is the lighting; on the rocks, the vacuum cleaner and the model, and the DOF is spot on -- it almost looks like a studio shot. Great colors, too.<br/> <br/>The frame is a tad on the heavy side though, and it makes the photo look smaller than it actually is.</td>', 'Heh, I smell a series coming on. What I like about it is the lighting; on the rocks, the vacuum cleaner and the model, and the DOF is spot on -- it almost looks like a studio shot. Great colors, too. The frame is a tad on the heavy side though, and it makes the photo look smaller than it actually is.', '2005-01-24 05:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128564, 137427, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is such a nice sunset and silhouette photo. I''m sure others will tell you that it''s a bit crooked. If you want to know how to fix that in Photoshop, just drop me a note. :-) Despite that, it''s still an excellent picture that works great for this challenge. Nice job!</td>', 'This is such a nice sunset and silhouette photo. I''m sure others will tell you that it''s a bit crooked. If you want to know how to fix that in Photoshop, just drop me a note. :-) Despite that, it''s still an excellent picture that works great for this challenge. Nice job!', '2005-01-24 05:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128575, 139189, 26679, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo and the grain really adds character.<br/>For me however, there is too much face visible.<br/></td>', 'This is a great photo and the grain really adds character.For me however, there is too much face visible.', '2005-01-24 05:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128578, 138875, 26679, '<td valign="top">Interesting market scene.<br/>For me however, there are too many faces visible for a challenge called Faceless.<br/></td>', 'Interesting market scene.For me however, there are too many faces visible for a challenge called Faceless.', '2005-01-24 05:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128585, 139333, 26679, '<td valign="top">Sponge Bob in the snow. Not a scene you would normally expect.<br/>This is a fun image with an interesting mixture of yllow, mauve and yellow.<br/></td>', 'Sponge Bob in the snow. Not a scene you would normally expect.This is a fun image with an interesting mixture of yllow, mauve and yellow.', '2005-01-24 06:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
