(1128590, 138966, 26679, '<td valign="top">I love the imagery here, this is a great picture. <br/>I wish it was slightly more saturated. (just a gnats thingermejiggy though)<br/></td>', 'I love the imagery here, this is a great picture. I wish it was slightly more saturated. (just a gnats thingermejiggy though)', '2005-01-24 06:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
