(1128836, 139358, 16488, '<td valign="top">Technical quality is lacking in this image.  The selective desaturation combined with the oversaturation of the yellows has left unappealing spots on the subject''s arm.  The idea to obliterate the face by bouncing the flash of the mirror is commedable, and I guess that for some of us taking photos of ourselves in a mirror is "normal human activity" --just don''t think you pulled it off.  Don''t mean to sound harsh, just being honest with my opinion.</td>', 'Technical quality is lacking in this image.  The selective desaturation combined with the oversaturation of the yellows has left unappealing spots on the subject''s arm.  The idea to obliterate the face by bouncing the flash of the mirror is commedable, and I guess that for some of us taking photos of ourselves in a mirror is "normal human activity" --just don''t think you pulled it off.  Don''t mean to sound harsh, just being honest with my opinion.', '2005-01-24 09:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
