(1129415, 138966, 18191, '<td valign="top">Brilliant shot with great imagination. The red is really strong as is the perfect balance to the muted colors throughout the rest of the scene. Should see a ribbon --- 10.</td>', 'Brilliant shot with great imagination. The red is really strong as is the perfect balance to the muted colors throughout the rest of the scene. Should see a ribbon --- 10.', '2005-01-24 16:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1129468, 138966, 30342, '<td valign="top">I scored this high on my scale but I just don''t think this is normal human activity in the location that you shot it.  But it is interesting and a good photo in general.</td>', 'I scored this high on my scale but I just don''t think this is normal human activity in the location that you shot it.  But it is interesting and a good photo in general.', '2005-01-24 17:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1129475, 139304, 30342, '<td valign="top">That tree kind of bugs me but it is a good photo.</td>', 'That tree kind of bugs me but it is a good photo.', '2005-01-24 17:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1129477, 138916, 30342, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2005-01-24 17:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1129480, 138814, 30342, '<td valign="top">I wish this photo was in another contest because it would have received a 10.  I just don''t see this as normal human activity.  dieing for your country doesn''t seem in the catagory of "normal" to me even though it''s going on right now.</td>', 'I wish this photo was in another contest because it would have received a 10.  I just don''t see this as normal human activity.  dieing for your country doesn''t seem in the catagory of "normal" to me even though it''s going on right now.', '2005-01-24 17:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1129494, 138920, 3032, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot, I like all the motion. The diagonal panning motion of the ground gives speed to the image and the blur of all the hands, legs and tails gives action. Good crop, some space for them to move in. Photos like this are so much better than frozen stills.<br/></td>', 'Nice action shot, I like all the motion. The diagonal panning motion of the ground gives speed to the image and the blur of all the hands, legs and tails gives action. Good crop, some space for them to move in. Photos like this are so much better than frozen stills.', '2005-01-24 17:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1129495, 139321, 30342, '<td valign="top">This could have been a really good photo.  It could use some sharpening and some new image work.</td>', 'This could have been a really good photo.  It could use some sharpening and some new image work.', '2005-01-24 17:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1129496, 138814, 3032, '<td valign="top">Interesting. I cannot relate to the background that well, but it is a very good concept. Some more damage and dirt on the in and outside of the helmet might work. I like the smoke, but a bit more intense could be better. 8</td>', 'Interesting. I cannot relate to the background that well, but it is a very good concept. Some more damage and dirt on the in and outside of the helmet might work. I like the smoke, but a bit more intense could be better. 8', '2005-01-24 17:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1129499, 139290, 3032, '<td valign="top">ROFL, priceless. :)<br/>Good one for next years christmass cards.</td>', 'ROFL, priceless. :)Good one for next years christmass cards.', '2005-01-24 17:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1129501, 139232, 3032, '<td valign="top">To me the snow he kicks up expresses joy. Good composition, the slight diagonal angle to the swing works well.</td>', 'To me the snow he kicks up expresses joy. Good composition, the slight diagonal angle to the swing works well.', '2005-01-24 17:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1129503, 139255, 14620, '<td valign="top">This shot has such wonderful warm tones.  I love the composition.  Well done!  One of my favorites.</td>', 'This shot has such wonderful warm tones.  I love the composition.  Well done!  One of my favorites.', '2005-01-24 17:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1129505, 138526, 3032, '<td valign="top">The light is a bit cool, creates a very harsh effect on the hair. Another whitebalance (warmer), color filter in front of the light source and/or a diffisuer in front of the light might work better.<br/>Good concept, like the composition and how the light falls with the face in the deep shadow.</td>', 'The light is a bit cool, creates a very harsh effect on the hair. Another whitebalance (warmer), color filter in front of the light source and/or a diffisuer in front of the light might work better.Good concept, like the composition and how the light falls with the face in the deep shadow.', '2005-01-24 17:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1129506, 139100, 14620, '<td valign="top">I really love the treatment of this photo.  It''s very clear and clean looking and such a great composition.  I''d love to know your workflow for this one! :-) 9</td>', 'I really love the treatment of this photo.  It''s very clear and clean looking and such a great composition.  I''d love to know your workflow for this one! :-) 9', '2005-01-24 17:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1129507, 138916, 14620, '<td valign="top">This is a really beautiful portrait.  I love the composition and the warmth of the shot.  Quite Beautiful!</td>', 'This is a really beautiful portrait.  I love the composition and the warmth of the shot.  Quite Beautiful!', '2005-01-24 17:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1129509, 138916, 3032, '<td valign="top">Wonderful, reversed warming graduated ND filter? Doesn''t matter how, it works. Very warm and romantic mood on what probably was a cold day. :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Wonderful, reversed warming graduated ND filter? Doesn''t matter how, it works. Very warm and romantic mood on what probably was a cold day. :) ', '2005-01-24 17:28:57.000000', NULL, 1);
