(1133225, 138743, 4281, '<td valign="top">Quite good!<br/>There are however few things about it that bother me a bit.<br/>a) The sunglasses sit unnaturally high (on the "face") and tilt strangely upwards.<br/>b) You are too close to the wall, imho, and I don''t like the shadow that falls on the wall to the left on the picture.<br/>c) I don''t like the wrinkled shirt collar.<br/> <br/>And I might add that the tie is a bit too dark and that you should have adjusted the jacket a bit better. ;)<br/>Otherwise, quite good actually.</td>', 'Quite good!There are however few things about it that bother me a bit.a) The sunglasses sit unnaturally high (on the "face") and tilt strangely upwards.b) You are too close to the wall, imho, and I don''t like the shadow that falls on the wall to the left on the picture.c) I don''t like the wrinkled shirt collar. And I might add that the tie is a bit too dark and that you should have adjusted the jacket a bit better. ;)Otherwise, quite good actually.', '2005-01-26 12:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
