(1135343, 138443, 259, '<td valign="top">great looking distractionless shot.  the shadow really adds a lot to the overall shot.  really nice job.</td>', 'great looking distractionless shot.  the shadow really adds a lot to the overall shot.  really nice job.', '2005-01-27 14:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
