(1135489, 138179, 5354, '<td valign="top">Needs to be sized properly, andto be honest it is lacking in WOW. Technically it looks nice enough but its not going to ribbon I''m afraid</td>', 'Needs to be sized properly, andto be honest it is lacking in WOW. Technically it looks nice enough but its not going to ribbon I''m afraid', '2005-01-27 16:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
