(1136690, 139080, 14620, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot.  You''ve captured the scene excellently.  The treatment is fantastic with all the details, textures and light.  Tthe composition is nice but the capture of their breath is what really makes this shot for me.  Well Done! Bumped to a 9</td>', 'This is a great shot.  You''ve captured the scene excellently.  The treatment is fantastic with all the details, textures and light.  Tthe composition is nice but the capture of their breath is what really makes this shot for me.  Well Done! Bumped to a 9', '2005-01-28 09:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136701, 139220, 14620, '<td valign="top">What I love most about this shot is the emotion it portrays.  It makes me smile to think about this couple and how many years they''ve probably spent together, the things they''ve been through and shared.  Her confident, sassy stance as opposed to his awkard, elderly one works nicely too.  I love that their dressed in what looks like their "Sunday Best" and that they probably know what the other is thinking without even saying a word.  BEAUTIFUL!  I''m glad you took the time to take this shot.</td>', 'What I love most about this shot is the emotion it portrays.  It makes me smile to think about this couple and how many years they''ve probably spent together, the things they''ve been through and shared.  Her confident, sassy stance as opposed to his awkard, elderly one works nicely too.  I love that their dressed in what looks like their "Sunday Best" and that they probably know what the other is thinking without even saying a word.  BEAUTIFUL!  I''m glad you took the time to take this shot.', '2005-01-28 09:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
