(1138169, 138619, 25464, '<td valign="top">My only suggestion for improvement here would be to get the work area entirely in the frame.  I would have liked to see all of the sparks in every direction.  Very nice shot.</td>', 'My only suggestion for improvement here would be to get the work area entirely in the frame.  I would have liked to see all of the sparks in every direction.  Very nice shot.', '2005-01-29 01:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
