(1138175, 137513, 27812, '<td valign="top">You may not win many points with this one as some people may not appreciate the symbolism or see the greater meaning of the culture involved. For me, great, 9.</td>', 'You may not win many points with this one as some people may not appreciate the symbolism or see the greater meaning of the culture involved. For me, great, 9.', '2005-01-29 01:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
