(1138259, 138717, 27812, '<td valign="top">nice idea, good lighting accept for the burn-out over the shoulders. crop to narrow. little more contrast? My comment, play with this pic, it is a good pic. Play with crop, contrast and try to sharpen a bit more. 6</td>', 'nice idea, good lighting accept for the burn-out over the shoulders. crop to narrow. little more contrast? My comment, play with this pic, it is a good pic. Play with crop, contrast and try to sharpen a bit more. 6', '2005-01-29 02:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
