(1139251, 139274, 7706, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and I think its kind of funny, but maybe go a little easier on the neat image next time. It gives some aspects of the photo a plastic look and also takes away a lot of important detail.</td>', 'I like the idea and I think its kind of funny, but maybe go a little easier on the neat image next time. It gives some aspects of the photo a plastic look and also takes away a lot of important detail.', '2005-01-29 20:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
