(1139259, 138179, 7706, '<td valign="top">I would like to see this image at 640 as you lose a lot of detail when its shrunk down.</td>', 'I would like to see this image at 640 as you lose a lot of detail when its shrunk down.', '2005-01-29 20:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139261, 138791, 7706, '<td valign="top">Awsome shot.</td>', 'Awsome shot.', '2005-01-29 20:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139269, 139264, 7706, '<td valign="top">The subject of the photo (the photographer) is way too far away and way too small. It almost seems more like a photo for the wheres waldo challenge. sorry.</td>', 'The subject of the photo (the photographer) is way too far away and way too small. It almost seems more like a photo for the wheres waldo challenge. sorry.', '2005-01-29 20:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139436, 138575, 4281, '<td valign="top">I understand you were trying to include the bird in the photograph but this picture would have been much better if the person walking the dog had been much more to the right of the frame so it would be like she''s entering the frame.<br/>The guy in the yellow jacket is also quite a distraction and if you would have managed to have exclude him from the picture (by taking it earlier or waiting for the next person walking a dog) it would be quite an improvement.<br/>In addition I sorta think that high-contrast B&amp;W would suit this picture much better than color. <br/> <br/>But I do like the pier and the footsteps in the sand in the foreground ...</td>', 'I understand you were trying to include the bird in the photograph but this picture would have been much better if the person walking the dog had been much more to the right of the frame so it would be like she''s entering the frame.The guy in the yellow jacket is also quite a distraction and if you would have managed to have exclude him from the picture (by taking it earlier or waiting for the next person walking a dog) it would be quite an improvement.In addition I sorta think that high-contrast B&W would suit this picture much better than color.  But I do like the pier and the footsteps in the sand in the foreground ...', '2005-01-29 20:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139463, 138644, 27812, '<td valign="top">the person self could be a little sharper 7<br/>Reurning to look at it again. The person could surely be sharper, however, looking at this picture as a whole it portrais a feeling of reflection, a needed moment of being alone and that makes this pic very good. The colors are beautiful, the composition actually great... Lot more appeal than the original score, bumping up to 9.</td>', 'the person self could be a little sharper 7Reurning to look at it again. The person could surely be sharper, however, looking at this picture as a whole it portrais a feeling of reflection, a needed moment of being alone and that makes this pic very good. The colors are beautiful, the composition actually great... Lot more appeal than the original score, bumping up to 9.', '2005-01-29 21:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139574, 138922, 3214, '<td valign="top">wow, love this, great toning, the translucence of the flags and the weather really comes across</td>', 'wow, love this, great toning, the translucence of the flags and the weather really comes across', '2005-01-29 22:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139650, 139215, 22970, '<td valign="top">LOL- Points for humor [humm should I hide until voting is over in that paper bag??]. Good shot</td>', 'LOL- Points for humor [humm should I hide until voting is over in that paper bag??]. Good shot', '2005-01-29 23:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139653, 138916, 22970, '<td valign="top">Should be on a card or calender. Very nice lighting focus and scene. 10</td>', 'Should be on a card or calender. Very nice lighting focus and scene. 10', '2005-01-30 00:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139654, 137593, 22970, '<td valign="top">Perfect timing. great candid.</td>', 'Perfect timing. great candid.', '2005-01-30 00:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139688, 138296, 4281, '<td valign="top">Nice lightning but the overexposed areas, the pants (it seems) and the model''s leftmost finger draw quite an attention to the themselves. <br/>I like how you place the model in the frame to the right.<br/> <br/>I also think the highlights in the hair should have been toned down a bit, but I guess that''s just my personal preference. As they are now, I find the highlights to be somewhat distracting.</td>', 'Nice lightning but the overexposed areas, the pants (it seems) and the model''s leftmost finger draw quite an attention to the themselves. I like how you place the model in the frame to the right. I also think the highlights in the hair should have been toned down a bit, but I guess that''s just my personal preference. As they are now, I find the highlights to be somewhat distracting.', '2005-01-30 01:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139775, 139080, 22970, '<td valign="top">Great Job, I love the back lighting. Not only did you capture three people in motion, faceless. I love the use of B&amp;W in this photograph. Excellent 10</td>', 'Great Job, I love the back lighting. Not only did you capture three people in motion, faceless. I love the use of B&W in this photograph. Excellent 10', '2005-01-30 02:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139777, 137517, 22970, '<td valign="top">Very emotive photograph with great technique and lighting. Excellent photograph 10.</td>', 'Very emotive photograph with great technique and lighting. Excellent photograph 10.', '2005-01-30 02:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139781, 138743, 22970, '<td valign="top">Very Creative and think this is a great photograph. IMO the sunglasses should be aimed at the camera a little more. But still a great shot.</td>', 'Very Creative and think this is a great photograph. IMO the sunglasses should be aimed at the camera a little more. But still a great shot.', '2005-01-30 03:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139782, 138847, 22970, '<td valign="top">Creative, nice color, lighting, focus and sharpness. Don''t understand using a child in the photograph but still a great shot.</td>', 'Creative, nice color, lighting, focus and sharpness. Don''t understand using a child in the photograph but still a great shot.', '2005-01-30 03:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139788, 138988, 22970, '<td valign="top">Perfect timing! Great Capture. Nice color, lighting, DOF, etc. Great job!</td>', 'Perfect timing! Great Capture. Nice color, lighting, DOF, etc. Great job!', '2005-01-30 03:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139792, 139189, 22970, '<td valign="top">Can''t explain it but for some reason I really like this shot. I think the grain effect worked well in liking of the photograph. Technically sound, great shot!</td>', 'Can''t explain it but for some reason I really like this shot. I think the grain effect worked well in liking of the photograph. Technically sound, great shot!', '2005-01-30 03:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139834, 137374, 16241, '<td valign="top">cute puppy!</td>', 'cute puppy!', '2005-01-30 04:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139836, 138338, 16241, '<td valign="top">figure would have had more impact if it wasn''t directly over the pole. the quality of the photograph is good.<br/></td>', 'figure would have had more impact if it wasn''t directly over the pole. the quality of the photograph is good.', '2005-01-30 04:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139843, 138966, 9668, '<td valign="top">I hope to see this in the top 10, top 5. Spectacularly random subject matter, I love it!</td>', 'I hope to see this in the top 10, top 5. Spectacularly random subject matter, I love it!', '2005-01-30 05:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139844, 138575, 9668, '<td valign="top">Nice sunset view of the beach. The pier, the wave, the dog, the backs, the seagull, the golden lighting: you''ve got all the elements going here.</td>', 'Nice sunset view of the beach. The pier, the wave, the dog, the backs, the seagull, the golden lighting: you''ve got all the elements going here.', '2005-01-30 05:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139846, 138743, 9668, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait. To me, the sun glasses seem pretty high up on the invisible face, but I don''t know what the invisible person''s face looks like, so I could be wrong =).  The shadows towards the left side are a bit distracting. Very minor: wrinkle on the back of the collar.  I''m wondering what this would look like with a pure white background (as apposed to gray). Excellent setup. 8</td>', 'Nice portrait. To me, the sun glasses seem pretty high up on the invisible face, but I don''t know what the invisible person''s face looks like, so I could be wrong =).  The shadows towards the left side are a bit distracting. Very minor: wrinkle on the back of the collar.  I''m wondering what this would look like with a pure white background (as apposed to gray). Excellent setup. 8', '2005-01-30 05:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139847, 139243, 9668, '<td valign="top">Awsome shot, love the balance of the subject (the person and dog) and the tree). Great composition.</td>', 'Awsome shot, love the balance of the subject (the person and dog) and the tree). Great composition.', '2005-01-30 05:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139848, 138644, 9668, '<td valign="top">Monet County? Reference to Monet? <br/>The bench seems to be tilting to the left (this wouldn''t bother me as much, but it is the only solid horizontal line in this shot). Excellent lighting and composition. Maybe a little higher angle could have got his hair below the hill ridge line, or a little lower angle would have pushed the hair alll the way through, right now seems like the two lines are conflicting sortof. 8</td>', 'Monet County? Reference to Monet? The bench seems to be tilting to the left (this wouldn''t bother me as much, but it is the only solid horizontal line in this shot). Excellent lighting and composition. Maybe a little higher angle could have got his hair below the hill ridge line, or a little lower angle would have pushed the hair alll the way through, right now seems like the two lines are conflicting sortof. 8', '2005-01-30 05:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139849, 139080, 9668, '<td valign="top">Awsome candid of runners, I can totally sympathize with the cold morning running experience. Like lighting through the fog in their breaths. Seems a tad oversharpened, but not that noticible, maybe the backlighting on their legs is harsh enough to get that effect. Well done.</td>', 'Awsome candid of runners, I can totally sympathize with the cold morning running experience. Like lighting through the fog in their breaths. Seems a tad oversharpened, but not that noticible, maybe the backlighting on their legs is harsh enough to get that effect. Well done.', '2005-01-30 05:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139850, 139201, 9668, '<td valign="top">Awsome evening light, great stop action, almost perfect focus. But like you''ve heard from others...</td>', 'Awsome evening light, great stop action, almost perfect focus. But like you''ve heard from others...', '2005-01-30 05:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139851, 139315, 9668, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, took me a while to figure out what was happening. Cool perspective, but lacks the clarity to make this image comprehendable.</td>', 'Interesting shot, took me a while to figure out what was happening. Cool perspective, but lacks the clarity to make this image comprehendable.', '2005-01-30 05:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139852, 139264, 9668, '<td valign="top">Took me a bit to find him, like where''s waldo all over again. Interesting perspective.</td>', 'Took me a bit to find him, like where''s waldo all over again. Interesting perspective.', '2005-01-30 05:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139934, 138814, 7560, '<td valign="top">I''m a big fan of photojournalistic images that tell a story. This one does that perfectly.  It has a timeless feel to it, could be any war, any country, any time. (Well not quite any time cause the helmet design is wrong, but you get my gist.) Nice job with the modeling, and the hint of smoke. It''s a little on the dark side (not subject wise, but light wise) and might be worth bumpin up a notch in density. 10</td>', 'I''m a big fan of photojournalistic images that tell a story. This one does that perfectly.  It has a timeless feel to it, could be any war, any country, any time. (Well not quite any time cause the helmet design is wrong, but you get my gist.) Nice job with the modeling, and the hint of smoke. It''s a little on the dark side (not subject wise, but light wise) and might be worth bumpin up a notch in density. 10', '2005-01-30 08:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139967, 138644, 22970, '<td valign="top">Something about this picture is bothering me but I can''t put my hands on it. It almost looks as if he is sitting in front of a large picture [backdrop/wallpaper or something]. Nice lighting and color of foreground subject and nice POV. Great job!</td>', 'Something about this picture is bothering me but I can''t put my hands on it. It almost looks as if he is sitting in front of a large picture [backdrop/wallpaper or something]. Nice lighting and color of foreground subject and nice POV. Great job!', '2005-01-30 09:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140023, 138920, 7910, '<td valign="top">Nice action.</td>', 'Nice action.', '2005-01-30 11:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140032, 138880, 7910, '<td valign="top">Nice.  I like the hand at the bottom just about to hit the mud.</td>', 'Nice.  I like the hand at the bottom just about to hit the mud.', '2005-01-30 11:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140034, 139339, 7910, '<td valign="top">A little soft, but nice angle.</td>', 'A little soft, but nice angle.', '2005-01-30 11:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140038, 138487, 7910, '<td valign="top">I hope he/she remembers to drop their pants.</td>', 'I hope he/she remembers to drop their pants.', '2005-01-30 11:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140040, 137506, 7910, '<td valign="top">Ahh, two things that go great together.</td>', 'Ahh, two things that go great together.', '2005-01-30 11:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140043, 138870, 7910, '<td valign="top">I like how every face is hidden.</td>', 'I like how every face is hidden.', '2005-01-30 11:38:29.000000', NULL, 1);
