(1140047, 139212, 7910, '<td valign="top">Looks like my neighborhood.  (north of Boston).   Even though it was a gray day, with all that white this could have used a little more overexposure to comensate for your camera''s meter reading.</td>', 'Looks like my neighborhood.  (north of Boston).   Even though it was a gray day, with all that white this could have used a little more overexposure to comensate for your camera''s meter reading.', '2005-01-30 11:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
