(1140567, 137517, 18191, '<td valign="top">Very emotive and well done. Speaks to the viewer, 10.</td>', 'Very emotive and well done. Speaks to the viewer, 10.', '2005-01-30 18:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140573, 138814, 2158, '<td valign="top">This is a great depiction of the power of war.  Good luck.</td>', 'This is a great depiction of the power of war.  Good luck.', '2005-01-30 18:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140606, 138494, 19405, '<td valign="top">Very good! But I think you should have had more contrast.</td>', 'Very good! But I think you should have had more contrast.', '2005-01-30 18:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140617, 139215, 19405, '<td valign="top">The picture have a little bit to much noise. And there is something in the light that dosn''t come out right. And the composition isn''t that good either.</td>', 'The picture have a little bit to much noise. And there is something in the light that dosn''t come out right. And the composition isn''t that good either.', '2005-01-30 18:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140621, 138966, 8891, '<td valign="top">Certainly surreal, think the foreground might have been a little brighter .If the background is real, which I suspect it is, I hope you paid your model well! Excellent and one of my favorites.</td>', 'Certainly surreal, think the foreground might have been a little brighter .If the background is real, which I suspect it is, I hope you paid your model well! Excellent and one of my favorites.', '2005-01-30 18:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140629, 137504, 8891, '<td valign="top">This is a very good abstract and I like the effect of the pan here while keeping some focus on the model''s head. Like the colors very much as well, very good choice of background colors as the green complements the red hair. Excellent.</td>', 'This is a very good abstract and I like the effect of the pan here while keeping some focus on the model''s head. Like the colors very much as well, very good choice of background colors as the green complements the red hair. Excellent.', '2005-01-30 18:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140631, 138443, 8891, '<td valign="top">Like  very much how the falling hair covers the face so well and the great shadow. Like the hi key in this as well. I suspect I know who this might be, but I have been wrong in the past so I well just keep it til later.  Good luck!</td>', 'Like  very much how the falling hair covers the face so well and the great shadow. Like the hi key in this as well. I suspect I know who this might be, but I have been wrong in the past so I well just keep it til later.  Good luck!', '2005-01-30 19:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140632, 139319, 19405, '<td valign="top">This came out a little bit to yellow.</td>', 'This came out a little bit to yellow.', '2005-01-30 19:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140636, 139215, 8891, '<td valign="top">Tell me about it.  I would love if they make an icon of this to use for ones in the challenge, though I don''t really ever give them. Just a riot, Like the grain, the tones and the textures very much as well as the lighting. Bag over the head indeed. ROFL! Great!!</td>', 'Tell me about it.  I would love if they make an icon of this to use for ones in the challenge, though I don''t really ever give them. Just a riot, Like the grain, the tones and the textures very much as well as the lighting. Bag over the head indeed. ROFL! Great!!', '2005-01-30 19:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140640, 139290, 8891, '<td valign="top">Got quite a tickle from this...reminds me of those witches they had around Halloween. LOL!  very much like your set up in this, how the path of the sled leads right to the tree and no evident footsteps around.  Also like all the shadows over the path. Nicely composed.</td>', 'Got quite a tickle from this...reminds me of those witches they had around Halloween. LOL!  very much like your set up in this, how the path of the sled leads right to the tree and no evident footsteps around.  Also like all the shadows over the path. Nicely composed.', '2005-01-30 19:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140643, 137729, 8891, '<td valign="top">Another favorite in this challenge. Like the minimalist appoach here and the use of backliighting with just the right amount of light left onf the hands so that I have no problem telling what is going on. Very nicely done and great idea for this theme.</td>', 'Another favorite in this challenge. Like the minimalist appoach here and the use of backliighting with just the right amount of light left onf the hands so that I have no problem telling what is going on. Very nicely done and great idea for this theme.', '2005-01-30 19:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140645, 139333, 8891, '<td valign="top">THe sponge bob hat under all that light purple just made me LOL! when I first saw this. Enjoyed it very much. Good luck!</td>', 'THe sponge bob hat under all that light purple just made me LOL! when I first saw this. Enjoyed it very much. Good luck!', '2005-01-30 19:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140649, 138260, 19405, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the title. But there is no photo that meets "faceless" as this one. You get my only 10. Hope you win.</td>', 'I don''t like the title. But there is no photo that meets "faceless" as this one. You get my only 10. Hope you win.', '2005-01-30 19:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140725, 139190, 24065, '<td valign="top">I have 2 favorites in this challenge -- and this is one of them.  That''s the good news -- the bad news is my taste usually runs counter to the rest of DPC.  I surely hope this one wins a ribbon, though.  It is a wonderful photograph.  You don''t need to see the man''s face to feel the reality of his life.  Good luck!  10</td>', 'I have 2 favorites in this challenge -- and this is one of them.  That''s the good news -- the bad news is my taste usually runs counter to the rest of DPC.  I surely hope this one wins a ribbon, though.  It is a wonderful photograph.  You don''t need to see the man''s face to feel the reality of his life.  Good luck!  10', '2005-01-30 20:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140726, 139080, 24065, '<td valign="top">This is one of my 2 favorites in this challenge.  I gave it a 10.  That''s the good new -- the bad news is I usually don''t pick the winners as my favorites!  However, I hope I''m in step with the rest of DPC this time and this one ribbons.  Good luck!</td>', 'This is one of my 2 favorites in this challenge.  I gave it a 10.  That''s the good new -- the bad news is I usually don''t pick the winners as my favorites!  However, I hope I''m in step with the rest of DPC this time and this one ribbons.  Good luck!', '2005-01-30 20:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
