(1141211, 138847, 25232, '<td valign="top">Let me address some of the comments I recieved during the voting. First off thank you for the votes and comments. For those of you who found this image disturbing, unsettling or creepy - great - that tells me I got my feeling across. The contrast in this image is strong if anything, but the colors are subdued. This I did on purpose. For those of you who have never woken up at 6 AM cold and damp in an alley, with paper in your mouth, and the world still spinning, then let me explain: Nothing is sunny and bright and full of colors. As far as the age of the model, lets just say that during Mardi Gras here in the US or Carnival in the rest of the world, the legal drinking age has more to do with being physically able to drink then about actual laws.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-01-31 01:45:41.</i></td>', 'Let me address some of the comments I recieved during the voting. First off thank you for the votes and comments. For those of you who found this image disturbing, unsettling or creepy - great - that tells me I got my feeling across. The contrast in this image is strong if anything, but the colors are subdued. This I did on purpose. For those of you who have never woken up at 6 AM cold and damp in an alley, with paper in your mouth, and the world still spinning, then let me explain: Nothing is sunny and bright and full of colors. As far as the age of the model, lets just say that during Mardi Gras here in the US or Carnival in the rest of the world, the legal drinking age has more to do with being physically able to drink then about actual laws.', '2005-01-31 00:16:07.000000', '2005-01-31 01:45:41.000000', 0),
