(1141649, 138009, 20066, '<td valign="top">Hey this is just great. <br/> <br/>Just twice before been under 4.9<br/>Just once before been under 20%<br/> <br/>This is an honor for me!<br/> <br/>But perhaps I should just get out of here!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-01-31 19:03:16.</i></td>', 'Hey this is just great.  Just twice before been under 4.9Just once before been under 20% This is an honor for me! But perhaps I should just get out of here!', '2005-01-31 04:22:59.000000', '2005-01-31 19:03:16.000000', 0),
