(1141710, 139080, 6999, '<td valign="top">Yay! I don''t know who holds the ''most overdue for a blue'' position now, Jon. Congratulations indeed.</td>', 'Yay! I don''t know who holds the ''most overdue for a blue'' position now, Jon. Congratulations indeed.', '2005-01-31 05:28:25.000000', NULL, 0),
