(1141797, 138743, 23478, '<td valign="top">Ok, 15th isn''t bad, but I am surprised this did not get a ribbon... great shot!</td>', 'Ok, 15th isn''t bad, but I am surprised this did not get a ribbon... great shot!', '2005-01-31 07:16:48.000000', NULL, 0),
