(1141817, 138280, 10634, '<td valign="top">Noticed you were looking for input as to why this didn''t fare all that well. First off, it''s not obvious that this is a priest. Second, the priest is too centered in the frame. Cropping out the white wall would have helped this as well as taking away the main eye attracter in the photo (the eye is drawn to that wall because it is in stark contrast to most everything else in the photo). <br/> <br/>Jen</td>', 'Noticed you were looking for input as to why this didn''t fare all that well. First off, it''s not obvious that this is a priest. Second, the priest is too centered in the frame. Cropping out the white wall would have helped this as well as taking away the main eye attracter in the photo (the eye is drawn to that wall because it is in stark contrast to most everything else in the photo).  Jen', '2005-01-31 07:32:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(1141818, 138922, 669, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot, JJ.  I think you suffered from not meeting the challenge in a very in-your-face way.</td>', 'Excellent shot, JJ.  I think you suffered from not meeting the challenge in a very in-your-face way.', '2005-01-31 07:33:16.000000', NULL, 0),
