(1141901, 138966, 30505, '<td valign="top">I gave you a 10 you should have gotten a ribbon. Excellent work.  I guessed it was yours and was right.</td>', 'I gave you a 10 you should have gotten a ribbon. Excellent work.  I guessed it was yours and was right.', '2005-01-31 09:14:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(1141915, 138280, 26475, '<td valign="top">I, for one, not being catholic, wouldn''t have known that this was a priest. Plus, the photo is out of focus. Also, as Jen said below, the eye is drawn to the sharp contrast of the white wall, more specifically, the water pipe.<br/> <br/>Stephanie</td>', 'I, for one, not being catholic, wouldn''t have known that this was a priest. Plus, the photo is out of focus. Also, as Jen said below, the eye is drawn to the sharp contrast of the white wall, more specifically, the water pipe. Stephanie', '2005-01-31 09:22:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(1141921, 138966, 4281, '<td valign="top">I''m wondering whether I''m biased about this photograph as I knew instantly who the author was and he happens to be a terrific photographer as well as a fellow Icelander. ;)<br/> <br/>Anyway, I frankly can''t understand how this picture could score so low and end up in the 11th place! It''s a good photograph, cute model, a bit surreal as well as funny, it has nice colors and composition, and there is no face showing.<br/> <br/>The only two reasons I could come up with to justify this picture''s low score is that the model''s face is cut off the frame instead of it being "faceless" in the strictest sense, and perhaps some people consider vacuuming at this certain place not to be an exactly normal activity (well, for people like Árni and Brynja, I''m sure it is normal to iron and vacuum at strange locations ...).</td>', 'I''m wondering whether I''m biased about this photograph as I knew instantly who the author was and he happens to be a terrific photographer as well as a fellow Icelander. ;) Anyway, I frankly can''t understand how this picture could score so low and end up in the 11th place! It''s a good photograph, cute model, a bit surreal as well as funny, it has nice colors and composition, and there is no face showing. The only two reasons I could come up with to justify this picture''s low score is that the model''s face is cut off the frame instead of it being "faceless" in the strictest sense, and perhaps some people consider vacuuming at this certain place not to be an exactly normal activity (well, for people like Árni and Brynja, I''m sure it is normal to iron and vacuum at strange locations ...).', '2005-01-31 09:28:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(1141922, 139190, 2223, '<td valign="top">Congrats on 5th! Beautiful shot!</td>', 'Congrats on 5th! Beautiful shot!', '2005-01-31 09:29:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(1141924, 139357, 2223, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous sunset, congrats!</td>', 'Gorgeous sunset, congrats!', '2005-01-31 09:30:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(1141930, 138966, 2223, '<td valign="top">This should have placed higher IMO, knew it was yours too!</td>', 'This should have placed higher IMO, knew it was yours too!', '2005-01-31 09:32:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(1141944, 138814, 2741, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by simchart:</b></div><hr/><i> I really find this offensive at this time! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Get over it. <br/> <br/>Its a great photo. If it offends you, look away, don''t vote and don''t comment. <br/> <br/>And I really don''t care if I get burned for this comment.</td>', 'Originally posted by simchart: I really find this offensive at this time!   Get over it.  Its a great photo. If it offends you, look away, don''t vote and don''t comment.  And I really don''t care if I get burned for this comment.', '2005-01-31 09:42:28.000000', NULL, 0),
