(1142047, 138443, 25754, '<td valign="top">Thank you so much everyone!!! I''m so glad this managed to stay in the top 3 since the score dipped the last day ... <br/>Thanks as always for your votes and comments.<br/> <br/>And I''m really really happy to have a shot that more than 10 people saved as a favourite :D<br/> <br/>Have to thank the hubby for his great taste in guitars, and without his <br/>Epiphone Les Paul Zakk Wylde this shot wouldn''t have been possible.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-02-01 18:27:28.</i></td>', 'Thank you so much everyone!!! I''m so glad this managed to stay in the top 3 since the score dipped the last day ... Thanks as always for your votes and comments. And I''m really really happy to have a shot that more than 10 people saved as a favourite :D Have to thank the hubby for his great taste in guitars, and without his Epiphone Les Paul Zakk Wylde this shot wouldn''t have been possible.', '2005-01-31 11:13:32.000000', '2005-02-01 18:27:28.000000', 0),
