(1143681, 139080, 20375, '<td valign="top">My only 10.<br/>There were a lot of good images here but as soon as I saw this one...<br/>the competition for 1st was over.<br/>Wow. Talk about being in the right position when these guys ran by!<br/>Congratulations x10...you better get a print made of this one and hang that baby up.<br/>(They should allow prints of ribbon winners for the entrants with a ribbon set into the corner!) Congrats again.<br/>Wow.</td>', 'My only 10.There were a lot of good images here but as soon as I saw this one...the competition for 1st was over.Wow. Talk about being in the right position when these guys ran by!Congratulations x10...you better get a print made of this one and hang that baby up.(They should allow prints of ribbon winners for the entrants with a ribbon set into the corner!) Congrats again.Wow.', '2005-02-01 00:31:16.000000', NULL, 0),
