(1144253, 138807, 1202, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by RHoldenSr:</b></div><hr/><i> Excellent shot.<br/> <br/>On my monitor I see a purple hue around the fine lines of the ropes and shield? How did you achieve the grayscale?<br/> <br/>I would have voted it a 7-8. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I used Channel Mixer for the grayscale and Photo Filter, to get the hew.  I was having trouble getting the cords to show up against the sunless/overcast sky, experimented and this seemed to work quite well.<br/> <br/>Thanks for the comment and question.</td>', 'Originally posted by RHoldenSr: Excellent shot. On my monitor I see a purple hue around the fine lines of the ropes and shield? How did you achieve the grayscale? I would have voted it a 7-8.   I used Channel Mixer for the grayscale and Photo Filter, to get the hew.  I was having trouble getting the cords to show up against the sunless/overcast sky, experimented and this seemed to work quite well. Thanks for the comment and question.', '2005-02-01 11:24:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(1144374, 138916, 13879, '<td valign="top">WOW!<br/>I''ve had the biggest cheesy grin on my face the last 24hours! I am so chuffed with my first ribbon (thinking about printing one out and sticking it to my chest...), and to get so many kind words especially from so my people whose work I really admire.  I really didnt think I''d do this well!  This year my 2 goals were:<br/>1) get a photo in the 7''s<br/>2) get a ribbon<br/>So I''m thinking of retiring now!<br/> <br/>Thanks again for all your votes, this has been a real boost to my confidence.<br/> <br/>Cheers<br/>MARK<br/> <br/>EDIT:<br/>Here is an out-take from the challenge, there was a dood walking past in this one, but i managed to clone him. Glad i submitted the one I did!<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=143121" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/13879/thumb/143121.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/13879/thumb/143121.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/13879/thumb/143121.jpg"/></a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-02-05 09:42:57.</i></td>', 'WOW!I''ve had the biggest cheesy grin on my face the last 24hours! I am so chuffed with my first ribbon (thinking about printing one out and sticking it to my chest...), and to get so many kind words especially from so my people whose work I really admire.  I really didnt think I''d do this well!  This year my 2 goals were:1) get a photo in the 7''s2) get a ribbonSo I''m thinking of retiring now! Thanks again for all your votes, this has been a real boost to my confidence. CheersMARK EDIT:Here is an out-take from the challenge, there was a dood walking past in this one, but i managed to clone him. Glad i submitted the one I did! ', '2005-02-01 12:49:09.000000', '2005-02-05 09:42:57.000000', 0),
