(1196238, 138847, 25232, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by saintaugust:</b></div><hr/><i> how exactly did you do this? looks like the face was added in afterwards..? talk about being ''off your face''! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Everything was done in camera except ajustments in color and contrast. The face on the boy is a paper mache mask that I made for this shot. The other is just a generic plastic blank mask that I painted and added eyes to.</td>', 'Originally posted by saintaugust: how exactly did you do this? looks like the face was added in afterwards..? talk about being ''off your face''!   Everything was done in camera except ajustments in color and contrast. The face on the boy is a paper mache mask that I made for this shot. The other is just a generic plastic blank mask that I painted and added eyes to.', '2005-02-26 22:25:41.000000', NULL, 0),
